@@ -0,0 +1,133 @@
+# Activities
+
+Activities are the events that make up the account's activity timeline: cards being added, assigned, moved, closed, or renamed, and comments being posted.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a paginated list of activity on the boards you have access to, newest first.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by the user ID(s) of whoever performed the activity |
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+[
+  {
+    "id": "03f5va03bpuvkcjemcxl73ho2",
+    "action": "card_assigned",
+    "eventable_type": "Card",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:48.553Z",
+    "description": "David Heinemeier Hansson assigned Jason Fried to &quot;First!&quot;",
+    "particulars": {
+      "assignee_ids": ["03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a8"]
+    },
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4",
+    "eventable": {
+      "id": "03f5vaeq985jlvwv3arl4srq2",
+      "number": 4,
+      "title": "First!",
+      "status": "published",
+      "description": "Hello, World!",
+      "description_html": "<div class=\"action-text-content\"><p>Hello, World!</p></div>",
+      "image_url": null,
+      "has_attachments": false,
+      "tags": ["programming"],
+      "closed": false,
+      "postponed": false,
+      "golden": false,
+      "last_active_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:48.553Z",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:48.540Z",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4",
+      "board": {
+        "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+        "name": "Fizzy",
+        "all_access": true,
+        "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+        "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+        "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+        "creator": {
+          "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+          "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+          "role": "owner",
+          "active": true,
+          "email_address": "david@example.com",
+          "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+          "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+        }
+      },
+      "creator": {
+        "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+        "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+        "role": "owner",
+        "active": true,
+        "email_address": "david@example.com",
+        "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+        "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+      },
+      "assignees": [
+        {
+          "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a8",
+          "name": "Jason Fried",
+          "role": "owner",
+          "active": true,
+          "email_address": "jason@example.com",
+          "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+          "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a8"
+        }
+      ],
+      "has_more_assignees": false,
+      "comments_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4/comments",
+      "reactions_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4/reactions"
+    },
+    "board": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "name": "Fizzy",
+      "all_access": true,
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+      "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "creator": {
+        "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+        "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+        "role": "owner",
+        "active": true,
+        "email_address": "david@example.com",
+        "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+        "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+      }
+    },
+    "creator": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+      "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+      "role": "owner",
+      "active": true,
+      "email_address": "david@example.com",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+    }
+  }
+]
+```
+
+`action` is one of:
+`card_published`, `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned`, `card_closed`, `card_reopened`, `card_postponed`, `card_auto_postponed`, `card_triaged`, `card_sent_back_to_triage`, `card_board_changed`, `card_title_changed`, `comment_created`
+
+`description` is the sentence shown in the activity timeline, in its plain-text form. It is HTML-escaped, so a quoted card title appears as `&quot;First!&quot;`.
+
+`eventable_type` is either `Card` or `Comment`, and `eventable` is the corresponding [card](cards.md) or [comment](comments.md). For card events, `url` opens the card. For comment events, it opens the card the comment was posted on and jumps to the comment.
+
+`particulars` holds details specific to the kind of activity. It's empty for every other action.
+
+| Action | Particulars |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned` | `assignee_ids`: the IDs of the users who were assigned or unassigned |
+| `card_board_changed` | `old_board` and `new_board`: the names of the boards the card was moved between |
+| `card_title_changed` | `old_title` and `new_title` |
+| `card_triaged` | `column`: the name of the column the card was moved to |
+
+Board, title, and column names that weren't recorded are returned as empty strings.
diff --git a/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb b/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..b697fac
